<title>ITALY: Bergamo air cargo traffic rises in March.</title>
<headline>Bergamo air cargo traffic rises in March.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bergamo airport authority said March cargo traffic totalled 4,587 tonnes compared 3,8768 in the same month last year.</p>
<p>Year to date tonnage was 12,370 tonnage against 10,415 in 1996.</p>
<p>Aircraft movements     March 97     March 96    Year	 Year</p>
<p>							  to date 97   to date 96</p>
<p>On line		    456	     146	  1387	   414</p>
<p>Charter		    203	     154	   523	  4516</p>
<p>Cargo Couriers	   635	     637	  1760	  1869</p>
<p>All Cargo		    2		 6	     2	    14</p>
<p>Other			 72		59	   454	   570</p>
<p>Total Commercial	1368	    1002	  4126	  3318</p>
<p>Aviation</p>
<p>Total General	    811	     746	  1713	  1613</p>
<p>Aviation</p>
